    "explain": "None of the project's workflows (.github/workflows/ci.yml) has a run step that invokes the test runner, coverage or Stryker, so whatever the runner config gates, nothing in CI executes it — a pull request goes green without the suite running. Add a step that runs the tests (for example `pnpm vitest run --coverage`) to a job that gates the merge, so the thresholds and skips the rest of these rules read are actually enforced.",
