    "explain": "The runner config sets no coverage thresholds, so coverage can fall to zero under a green build. Set `coverage.thresholds` (Vitest) or `coverageThreshold` (Jest) to the suite's current numbers and ratchet them up, so a drop below today's coverage fails the run rather than passing unnoticed.",
